{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Antivirus PROTOCOL</strong> is an incremental game about destroying viruses. Learn and adapt, collect data, upgrade yourself, and eliminate the Virus that has taken over the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DESTROY VIRUSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797060/extras/gameplay2.gif?t=1749592858\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect various code fragments and data from viruses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UPGRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797060/extras/skilltree2.gif?t=1749592858\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the collected data to upgrade yourself and unlock\u00a0powerful new weapons and abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CLEAR THE LEVEL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797060/extras/bossfight2.gif?t=1749592858\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill the Virus Boss at the end of the level to progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REPEAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advance through levels to unlock new enemies and gather more data.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PROLOGUE FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfying Incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple resources to collect</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extensive upgrade tree with 45+ upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide variety of unique weapons and droppable powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short, fun and engaging experience with about 35-40 minutes of playtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing, satisfying gameplay</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797060?t=1749592858","background_raw":"https